{"name":"Outrigger","hex":"#82714d","fetched":"2026-10-12","looked":{"definitions":[{"term":"outrigger","whole":true,"parts":[{"part":"Noun","definitions":["Any of various projecting beams or spars that provide support for a sailing ship's mast.","A long thin timber, pontoon, or other float attached parallel to a canoe or boat by projecting struts as a means of preventing tipping or capsizing."]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/outrigger"}],"entries":[{"title":"Outrigger","blocks":[{"text":"An outrigger is a projecting structure on a boat, with specific meaning depending on types of vessel. Outriggers may also refer to legs on a wheeled vehicle that are folded out when it needs stabilization, for example on a crane that lifts heavy loads."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/e/e2/COLLECTIE_TROPENMUSEUM_Reli%C3%ABf_op_de_Borobudur_TMnr_20025669.jpg/330px-COLLECTIE_TROPENMUSEUM_Reli%C3%ABf_op_de_Borobudur_TMnr_20025669.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Outrigger","wikidata":"Q2562991"}],"images":[{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/8/8f/Outrigger_on_Hawaiian_sailing_canoe.png/500px-Outrigger_on_Hawaiian_sailing_canoe.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x, https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/8/8f/Outrigger_on_Hawaiian_sailing_canoe.png/1280px-Outrigger_on_Hawaiian_sailing_canoe.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 2x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/8/8f/Outrigger_on_Hawaiian_sailing_canoe.png/500px-Outrigger_on_Hawaiian_sailing_canoe.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"Outrigger on a contemporary Hawaiian sailing canoe","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3AOutrigger_on_Hawaiian_sailing_canoe.png"},{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/d/d